stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Proposed
    Proposed --> Proofing
    Proofing --> Active: requirements satisfied
    Proofing --> Retired: abandoned or rejected
    Active --> Restricted: risk or limited relationship
    Restricted --> Active: conditions restored
    Active --> Suspended: temporary containment
    Restricted --> Suspended
    Suspended --> Recovery: approved recovery
    Recovery --> Active: assurance restored
    Active --> Revoked: authority ended
    Restricted --> Revoked
    Suspended --> Revoked
    Revoked --> Retired: disposition complete
    Retired --> [*]

